<main class="wrap">
  <p>This Privacy Policy explains how Blended ("we," "us," or "our") handles information when you visit blended.com (the "Site") or interact with our Pinterest profile.</p>

  <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
  <p>Blended is primarily a content and curation site. We do not require you to create an account or submit personal information to browse the Site. We may collect limited information in the following ways:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Contact form submissions:</strong> if you reach out through our Contact page or email, we receive whatever information you choose to share (such as your name, email address, and message).</li>
    <li><strong>Standard web analytics:</strong> like most websites, our hosting provider and any analytics tools we use may automatically log basic technical data such as browser type, device type, and pages visited, typically through cookies or similar technologies.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
  <p>Any information collected is used only to respond to inquiries, understand how visitors use the Site, and improve our content and recommendations. We do not sell personal information to third parties.</p>

  <h2>Third-Party Links and Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
  <p>Blended participates in the Amazon Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by linking to Amazon.com. When you click a product link on this Site or on our Pinterest boards, you will be directed to Amazon's website, which has its own privacy policy and data practices independent of ours. We encourage you to review Amazon's privacy policy before making a purchase.</p>
  <p>We are not responsible for the content, privacy policies, or practices of any third-party sites linked from Blended.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>Cookies may be used by our hosting provider, embedded fonts, or any analytics tools to support basic site functionality and understand aggregate traffic patterns. You can control or disable cookies through your browser settings at any time.</p>

  <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>Blended is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

  <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.</p>

  <h2>Contact Us</h2>
  <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please reach out through our <a href="contact.html">Contact page</a>.</p>
</main>

